\f1\fs22 \'91Look.\'92 Dunhilton took a breath and reset his mental map. \'91Before we address the Elvi issue, I wish to address the Scarlett Shower Surgeon case. Gerry?\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Yes, very good,\'92 Gerry agreed. \'91Case closed. Forensics have concluded that the weapon we retrieved last night was indeed used in all the other cases.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91You\'92ve laid charges?\'92 Heston, the Minister of Freedom, asked, unable to dissolve his glaze of surprise a the news.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Well, as you would know, Freedom, the perpetrator of these hateful crimes died of his injuries last evening.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91But\'85\'92 Heston stammered.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91During a scuffle, he was ironically slain with his own murder weapon,\'92 Gerry said as if he was schooling a child.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Heston took breath to say more, so Gerry added. \'91For apprehending the culprit, I\'92ll be awarding a commendation to Lieutenant Alexander Shakti.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>The room chilled. In the silence, Moral Observance relented and reached across to grab a pastry.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Case closed, indeed,\'92 Defence said rather too smugly.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Heston blinked nervously and went on blinking while a nervous tic developed at the corner of his mouth.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91And on other matters entirely,\'92 Dunhilton said, cheering up immensely, \'91the Director of Freedom has regrettably elected to resign.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91What?\'92 was the only objection Heston could fashion.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Dunhilton didn\'92t miss a beat. \'91Police Commissioner Hardman will step in as acting Director of Freedom. As well as Director of Elvi Rights.\'92 Dunhilton shot a gaze through his eyebrows down the table at the stricken ex-director \'91Oh, sorry, Millicent, you\'92re fired as of thirty minutes ago. Now get out. Both of you get out now, or you\'92ll both be hugging pillows.\'92
